{"id":"41938aaba0a16fffb2f663cf07238826929ad18c","axis":"silent","repo":"envoyproxy/envoy","sha":"41938aaba0a16fffb2f663cf07238826929ad18c","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"changelogs/current/new_features/dynamic_modules__bootstrap_snapshot.rst","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@","+Added configuration snapshots for bootstrap dynamic modules, with provider selection, resource","+name filtering and sensitive-field redaction, through","+``envoy_dynamic_module_callback_bootstrap_extension_config_snapshot_new``,","+``envoy_dynamic_module_callback_bootstrap_extension_config_snapshot_serialize`` and","+``envoy_dynamic_module_callback_bootstrap_extension_config_snapshot_delete``. The Rust SDK exposes","+``EnvoyBootstrapExtensionConfig::get_config_snapshot`` and","+``EnvoyBootstrapExtensionConfigSnapshot::into_json``; dropping the snapshot releases it. See","+:ref:`configuration snapshots <config_bootstrap_extensions_dynamic_modules_config_snapshots>`."],"additions":8,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"docs/root/configuration/other_features/bootstrap_extensions/dynamic_modules.rst","lines":["@@ -215,6 +215,47 @@ prefix, tagged with ``config_name`` set to the extension name, or ``default`` if","   listeners_owned, Gauge, Listeners that the module owns","   updates_pending, Gauge, Writes that are queued or warming or that wait for the workers to start"," ","+.. _config_bootstrap_extensions_dynamic_modules_config_snapshots:","+","+Configuration Snapshots","+-----------------------","+","+Bootstrap modules can collect selected configuration providers with","+``envoy_dynamic_module_callback_bootstrap_extension_config_snapshot_new``. The Rust SDK exposes","+this as ``get_config_snapshot``.","+","+Provider keys include ``bootstrap``, ``clusters``, ``listeners``,","+``routes``, ``route_scopes``, ``secrets`` and the registered ``ecds_filter_*`` providers. Missing keys","+are omitted, duplicates are collected once, and an empty selection collects nothing. Providers","+appear in key order, as in :ref:`/config_dump <operations_admin_interface_config_dump>`.","+Endpoint dumps are not included. An optional full-match RE2 regular expression filters resource names","+for providers that support it. A missing or empty expression disables filtering.","+","+Collection and sensitive-field redaction run synchronously on the main thread after server","+initialization and before shutdown begins. Their cost grows with the selected resources. Combine","+frequent notifications into one collection.","+","+Collection is refused in cluster or listener lifecycle hooks, whatever triggered them, and in","+other bootstrap hooks Envoy runs inside an xDS update or a resource's destruction. Providers can","+contain partially applied changes with an old version. Defer collection with the bootstrap config","+scheduler. Callout failures during cluster removal are already reported from a posted callback.","+","+Creation returns a result distinguishing a refused call, an invalid or oversized name expression,","+unavailable admin support, and a provider failure. Calls are refused off the main thread, before","+initialization, after shutdown begins, inside those hooks, or while another collection runs.","+","+JSON encoding can also be expensive. Use a module-owned thread to avoid blocking Envoy's main thread","+or workers. Encoding and deletion can run on any thread. Release each snapshot before its owning","+bootstrap configuration's destroy hook returns. Modules must stop and join workers holding snapshots","+during configuration teardown. A snapshot must not be used concurrently.","+","+Redaction covers only protobuf fields annotated as sensitive, as with ``/config_dump``. Metadata,","+opaque strings and module configuration can still contain sensitive data. JSON encoding can fail","+when an ``Any`` contains an unknown or unlinked protobuf type.","+","+This API needs admin support compiled in, but does not need an admin listener and is not restricted","+by admin ``allow_paths``.","+"," Use Cases"," ---------"," "],"additions":41,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"source/extensions/bootstrap/dynamic_modules/BUILD","lines":["@@ -9,6 +9,22 @@ licenses([\"notice\"])  # Apache 2"," "," envoy_extension_package()"," ","+envoy_cc_library(","+    name = \"config_snapshot_lib\",","+    srcs = [\"config_snapshot.cc\"],","+    hdrs = [\"config_snapshot.h\"],","+    deps = [","+        \"//envoy/common:exception_lib\",","+        \"//envoy/server:config_tracker_interface\",","+        \"//source/common/protobuf:utility_lib\",","+        \"@abseil-cpp//absl/algorithm:container\",","+        \"@abseil-cpp//absl/status:statusor\",","+        \"@abseil-cpp//absl/strings\",","+        \"@abseil-cpp//absl/types:span\",","+        \"@envoy_api//envoy/admin/v3:pkg_cc_proto\",","+    ],","+)","+"," envoy_cc_library(","     name = \"cluster_writer_lib\",","     srcs = [\"cluster_writer.cc\"],","@@ -99,10 +115,12 @@ envoy_cc_library(","     hdrs = [\"extension_config.h\"],","     deps = [","         \":cluster_writer_lib\",","+        \":config_snapshot_lib\",","         \":listener_writer_lib\",","         \"//envoy/common:optref_lib\",","         \"//envoy/event:dispatcher_interface\",","         \"//envoy/http:async_client_interface\",","+        \"//envoy/server:admin_interface\",","         \"//envoy/server:factory_context_interface\",","         \"//envoy/server:listener_manager_interface\",","         \"//envoy/server:options_interface\",","@@ -110,7 +128,10 @@ envoy_cc_library(","         \"//envoy/thread_local:thread_local_interface\",","         \"//source/common/buffer:buffer_lib\",","         \"//source/common/common:assert_lib\",","+        \"//source/common/common:cleanup_lib\",","         \"//source/common/common:logger_lib\",","+        \"//source/common/common:matchers_lib\",","+        \"//source/common/common:regex_lib\",","         \"//source/common/common:thread_lib\",","         \"//source/common/http:message_lib\",","         \"//source/common/init:target_lib\",","@@ -143,6 +164,7 @@ envoy_cc_library(","     name = \"abi_impl\",","     srcs = [\"abi_impl.cc\"],","     deps = [","+        \":config_snapshot_lib\",","         \":extension_config_lib\",","         \":extension_lib\",","         \"//envoy/server:admin_interface\",","@@ -150,6 +172,7 @@ envoy_cc_library(","         \"//source/common/stats:symbol_table_lib\",","         \"//source/common/stats:utility_lib\",","         \"//source/extensions/dynamic_modules:dynamic_modules_lib\",","+        \"@abseil-cpp//absl/container:inlined_vector\",","         \"@abseil-cpp//absl/strings\",","     ],"," )"],"additions":23,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"source/extensions/bootstrap/dynamic_modules/abi_impl.cc","lines":["@@ -14,8 +14,10 @@"," #include \"source/extensions/bootstrap/dynamic_modules/extension_config.h\""," #include \"source/extensions/dynamic_modules/abi/abi.h\""," ","+#include \"absl/container/inlined_vector.h\""," #include \"absl/strings/str_cat.h\""," ","+using Envoy::Extensions::Bootstrap::DynamicModules::ConfigSnapshot;"," using Envoy::Extensions::Bootstrap::DynamicModules::DynamicModuleBootstrapExtension;"," using Envoy::Extensions::Bootstrap::DynamicModules::DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig;"," using Envoy::Extensions::Bootstrap::DynamicModules::DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfigScheduler;","@@ -735,6 +737,64 @@ bool envoy_dynamic_module_callback_bootstrap_extension_remove_admin_handler(","   return admin->removeHandler(prefix_str);"," }"," ","+envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_config_snapshot_result","+envoy_dynamic_module_callback_bootstrap_extension_config_snapshot_new(","+    envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_extension_config_envoy_ptr config_envoy_ptr,","+    const envoy_dynamic_module_type_module_buffer* providers, size_t providers_count,","+    envoy_dynamic_module_type_module_buffer name_regex,","+    envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_extension_config_snapshot_module_ptr* snapshot_out) {","+  *snapshot_out = nullptr;","+  if (!Envoy::Thread::MainThread::isMainOrTestThread()) {","+    IS_ENVOY_BUG(absl::StrCat(__func__, \" must be called on the main thread\"));","+    return envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_config_snapshot_result_NotAllowed;","+  }","+  auto* config = static_cast<DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig*>(config_envoy_ptr);","+  absl::InlinedVector<absl::string_view, 4> names;","+  names.reserve(providers_count);","+  for (size_t i = 0; i < providers_count; ++i) {","+    names.emplace_back(providers[i].ptr, providers[i].length);","+  }","+  auto snapshot = config->getConfigSnapshot(","+      names, name_regex.ptr != nullptr ? absl::string_view(name_regex.ptr, name_regex.length)","+                                       : absl::string_view{});","+  if (!snapshot.ok()) {","+    ENVOY_LOG_TO_LOGGER(Envoy::Logger::Registry::getLog(Envoy::Logger::Id::dynamic_modules), debug,","+                        \"dynamic modules: config snapshot collection failed: {}\",","+                        snapshot.status());","+    switch (snapshot.status().code()) {","+    case absl::StatusCode::kFailedPrecondition:","+      return envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_config_snapshot_result_NotAllowed;","+    case absl::StatusCode::kInvalidArgument:","+      return envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_config_snapshot_result_InvalidRegex;","+    case absl::StatusCode::kUnavailable:","+      return envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_config_snapshot_result_Unavailable;","+    default:","+      return envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_config_snapshot_result_CollectionFailed;","+    }","+  }","+  *snapshot_out = snapshot.value().release();","+  return envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_config_snapshot_result_Success;","+}","+","+bool envoy_dynamic_module_callback_bootstrap_extension_config_snapshot_serialize(","+    envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_extension_config_snapshot_module_ptr snapshot,","+    envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_extension_config_snapshot_json_fn json_fn,","+    void* user_data) {","+  auto json = static_cast<ConfigSnapshot*>(snapshot)->serialize();","+  if (!json.ok()) {","+    ENVOY_LOG_TO_LOGGER(Envoy::Logger::Registry::getLog(Envoy::Logger::Id::dynamic_modules), debug,","+                        \"dynamic modules: config snapshot encoding failed: {}\", json.status());","+    return false;","+  }","+  json_fn({json->data(), json->size()}, user_data);","+  return true;","+}","+","+void envoy_dynamic_module_callback_bootstrap_extension_config_snapshot_delete(","+    envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_extension_config_snapshot_module_ptr snapshot) {","+  delete static_cast<ConfigSnapshot*>(snapshot);","+}","+"," // -------------------- Cluster Lifecycle Callbacks --------------------"," "," bool envoy_dynamic_module_callback_bootstrap_extension_enable_cluster_lifecycle("],"additions":60,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"source/extensions/bootstrap/dynamic_modules/config_snapshot.cc","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,61 @@","+#include \"source/extensions/bootstrap/dynamic_modules/config_snapshot.h\"","+","+#include \"envoy/admin/v3/config_dump.pb.h\"","+","+#include \"source/common/protobuf/utility.h\"","+","+#include \"absl/algorithm/container.h\"","+#include \"absl/strings/str_cat.h\"","+","+namespace Envoy {","+namespace Extensions {","+namespace Bootstrap {","+namespace DynamicModules {","+","+absl::StatusOr<std::unique_ptr<ConfigSnapshot>>","+ConfigSnapshot::collect(const Server::ConfigTracker& tracker,","+                        absl::Span<const absl::string_view> providers,","+                        const Matchers::StringMatcher& name_matcher) {","+  auto snapshot = std::make_unique<ConfigSnapshot>();","+  TRY_ASSERT_MAIN_THREAD {","+    std::vector<std::string> selected;","+    const auto& callbacks = tracker.getCallbacksMap();","+    for (const auto& [name, _] : callbacks) {","+      if (absl::c_linear_search(providers, name)) {","+        selected.push_back(name);","+      }","+    }","+    for (const auto& name : selected) {","+      // an earlier provider may have unregistered or replaced this callback","+      const auto it = callbacks.find(name);","+      if (it == callbacks.end()) {","+        continue;","+      }","+      // keep the current callback alive if it unregisters itself","+      const auto callback = it->second;","+      auto message = callback(name_matcher);","+      if (message == nullptr) {","+        return absl::InternalError(absl::StrCat(\"config provider returned no message: \", name));","+      }","+      MessageUtil::redact(*message);","+      snapshot->messages_.push_back(std::move(message));","+    }","+  }","+  END_TRY CATCH(const EnvoyException& e, { return absl::InternalError(e.what()); });","+  return snapshot;","+}","+","+absl::StatusOr<std::string> ConfigSnapshot::serialize() const {","+  envoy::admin::v3::ConfigDump dump;","+  for (const auto& message : messages_) {","+    if (!dump.add_configs()->PackFrom(*message)) {","+      return absl::InternalError(\"could not pack config provider message\");","+    }","+  }","+  return MessageUtil::getJsonStringFromMessage(dump);","+}","+","+} // namespace DynamicModules","+} // namespace Bootstrap","+} // namespace Extensions","+} // namespace Envoy"],"additions":61,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"source/extensions/bootstrap/dynamic_modules/config_snapshot.h","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,42 @@","+#pragma once","+","+#include <memory>","+#include <string>","+#include <vector>","+","+#include \"envoy/server/config_tracker.h\"","+","+#include \"absl/status/statusor.h\"","+#include \"absl/strings/string_view.h\"","+#include \"absl/types/span.h\"","+","+namespace Envoy {","+namespace Extensions {","+namespace Bootstrap {","+namespace DynamicModules {","+","+/**","+ * A snapshot of the selected configuration providers.","+ */","+class ConfigSnapshot {","+public:","+  /**","+   * Collects and redacts the selected providers. Must run on the server's main thread.","+   */","+  static absl::StatusOr<std::unique_ptr<ConfigSnapshot>>","+  collect(const Server::ConfigTracker& tracker, absl::Span<const absl::string_view> providers,","+          const Matchers::StringMatcher& name_matcher);","+","+  /**","+   * Encodes the snapshot as ConfigDump JSON. Can run on any thread.","+   */","+  absl::StatusOr<std::string> serialize() const;","+","+private:","+  std::vector<ProtobufTypes::MessagePtr> messages_;","+};","+","+} // namespace DynamicModules","+} // namespace Bootstrap","+} // namespace Extensions","+} // namespace Envoy"],"additions":42,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"source/extensions/bootstrap/dynamic_modules/extension_config.cc","lines":["@@ -1,11 +1,16 @@"," #include \"source/extensions/bootstrap/dynamic_modules/extension_config.h\""," "," #include <algorithm>","+#include <utility>"," #include <vector>"," ","+#include \"envoy/server/admin.h\""," #include \"envoy/server/options.h\""," "," #include \"source/common/common/assert.h\"","+#include \"source/common/common/cleanup.h\"","+#include \"source/common/common/matchers.h\"","+#include \"source/common/common/regex.h\""," #include \"source/common/common/thread.h\""," "," #include \"absl/container/flat_hash_set.h\"","@@ -15,6 +20,15 @@ namespace Envoy {"," namespace Extensions {"," namespace Bootstrap {"," namespace DynamicModules {","+namespace {","+","+// cluster/listener lifecycle hooks must set this flag; other bootstrap hooks must also set it","+// when run inside xDS updates or resource destruction","+thread_local bool in_resource_lifecycle_callback = false;","+// both flags are shared across configs because callbacks can reenter another config on this thread","+thread_local bool collecting_config_snapshot = false;","+","+} // namespace"," "," DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig::DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig(","     const absl::string_view extension_name, const absl::string_view extension_config,","@@ -91,9 +105,36 @@ bool DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig::enableClusterLifecycle() {","   return true;"," }"," ","+absl::StatusOr<std::unique_ptr<ConfigSnapshot>>","+DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig::getConfigSnapshot(","+    absl::Span<const absl::string_view> providers, absl::string_view name_regex) {","+  if (!server_initialized_ || shutdown_started_ || extension_destroyed_) {","+    return absl::FailedPreconditionError(\"config providers are unavailable\");","+  }","+  if (in_resource_lifecycle_callback || collecting_config_snapshot) {","+    return absl::FailedPreconditionError(","+        \"config snapshot requested during a resource lifecycle hook or snapshot collection\");","+  }","+  collecting_config_snapshot = true;","+  Cleanup cleanup([]() { collecting_config_snapshot = false; });","+  auto server_admin = admin();","+  if (!server_admin.has_value()) {","+    return absl::UnavailableError(\"admin config tracker is unavailable\");","+  }","+  if (!name_regex.empty()) {","+    auto matcher = Regex::CompiledGoogleReMatcher::createAndSizeCheck(std::string(name_regex));","+    RETURN_IF_NOT_OK(matcher.status());","+    return ConfigSnapshot::collect(server_admin->getConfigTracker(), providers, **matcher);","+  }","+  return ConfigSnapshot::collect(server_admin->getConfigTracker(), providers,","+                                 Matchers::UniversalStringMatcher{});","+}","+"," void DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig::onClusterAddOrUpdate(","     absl::string_view cluster_name, Upstream::ThreadLocalClusterCommand&) {","   if (in_module_config_ != nullptr && on_bootstrap_extension_cluster_add_or_update_ != nullptr) {","+    const bool previous = std::exchange(in_resource_lifecycle_callback, true);","+    Cleanup cleanup([previous]() { in_resource_lifecycle_callback = previous; });","     on_bootstrap_extension_cluster_add_or_update_(thisAsVoidPtr(), in_module_config_,","                                                   {cluster_name.data(), cluster_name.size()});","   }","@@ -101,6 +142,8 @@ void DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig::onClusterAddOrUpdate("," "," void DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig::onClusterRemoval(absl::string_view cluster_name) {","   if (in_module_config_ != nullptr && on_bootstrap_extension_cluster_removal_ != nullptr) {","+    const bool previous = std::exchange(in_resource_lifecycle_callback, true);","+    Cleanup cleanup([previous]() { in_resource_lifecycle_callback = previous; });","     on_bootstrap_extension_cluster_removal_(thisAsVoidPtr(), in_module_config_,","                                             {cluster_name.data(), cluster_name.size()});","   }","@@ -130,6 +173,8 @@ bool DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig::enableListenerLifecycle() {"," void DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig::onListenerAddOrUpdate(absl::string_view listener_name,","                                                                   const Network::ListenerConfig&) {","   if (in_module_config_ != nullptr && on_bootstrap_extension_listener_add_or_update_ != nullptr) {","+    const bool previous = std::exchange(in_resource_lifecycle_callback, true);","+    Cleanup cleanup([previous]() { in_resource_lifecycle_callback = previous; });","     on_bootstrap_extension_listener_add_or_update_(thisAsVoidPtr(), in_module_config_,","                                                    {listener_name.data(), listener_name.size()});","   }","@@ -137,6 +182,8 @@ void DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig::onListenerAddOrUpdate(absl::string_v"," "," void DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig::onListenerRemoval(const std::string& listener_name) {","   if (in_module_config_ != nullptr && on_bootstrap_extension_listener_removal_ != nullptr) {","+    const bool previous = std::exchange(in_resource_lifecycle_callback, true);","+    Cleanup cleanup([previous]() { in_resource_lifecycle_callback = previous; });","     on_bootstrap_extension_listener_removal_(thisAsVoidPtr(), in_module_config_,","                                              {listener_name.data(), listener_name.size()});","   }"],"additions":47,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"source/extensions/bootstrap/dynamic_modules/extension_config.h","lines":["@@ -18,6 +18,7 @@"," #include \"source/common/http/message_impl.h\""," #include \"source/common/init/target_impl.h\""," #include \"source/extensions/bootstrap/dynamic_modules/cluster_writer.h\"","+#include \"source/extensions/bootstrap/dynamic_modules/config_snapshot.h\""," #include \"source/extensions/bootstrap/dynamic_modules/listener_writer.h\""," #include \"source/extensions/dynamic_modules/abi/abi.h\""," #include \"source/extensions/dynamic_modules/dynamic_modules.h\"","@@ -162,6 +163,12 @@ class DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig","    */","   bool enableClusterLifecycle();"," ","+  /**","+   * Collects and redacts the selected configuration providers on the main thread.","+   */","+  absl::StatusOr<std::unique_ptr<ConfigSnapshot>>","+  getConfigSnapshot(absl::Span<const absl::string_view> providers, absl::string_view name_regex);","+","   // Upstream::ClusterUpdateCallbacks","   void onClusterAddOrUpdate(absl::string_view cluster_name,","                             Upstream::ThreadLocalClusterCommand& get_cluster) override;"],"additions":7,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"source/extensions/dynamic_modules/abi/abi.h","lines":["@@ -9577,6 +9577,42 @@ typedef enum {","   envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_active_resource_kind_Secret = 3,"," } envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_active_resource_kind;"," ","+/**","+ * A configuration snapshot owned by the module. Release it with","+ * envoy_dynamic_module_callback_bootstrap_extension_config_snapshot_delete before","+ * envoy_dynamic_module_on_bootstrap_extension_config_destroy returns for its owning config.","+ * It may move between threads, but must not be used concurrently.","+ */","+typedef void* envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_extension_config_snapshot_module_ptr;","+","+/**","+ * Receives JSON owned by Envoy and valid only during this invocation.","+ *","+ * @param json is the encoded snapshot. Its pointer is non-null.","+ * @param user_data is the opaque pointer supplied to the serialize callback and may be null.","+ */","+typedef void (*envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_extension_config_snapshot_json_fn)(","+    envoy_dynamic_module_type_envoy_buffer json, void* user_data);","+","+/**","+ * The result of envoy_dynamic_module_callback_bootstrap_extension_config_snapshot_new.","+ */","+typedef enum envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_config_snapshot_result {","+  // the snapshot was collected and redacted","+  envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_config_snapshot_result_Success = 0,","+  // called off the main thread, before","+  // envoy_dynamic_module_on_bootstrap_extension_server_initialized, during shutdown, from a","+  // cluster or listener lifecycle hook, whatever triggered it, from another bootstrap hook Envoy","+  // runs inside an xDS update or a resource's destruction, or while another collection runs","+  envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_config_snapshot_result_NotAllowed = 1,","+  // the name regex is invalid or its RE2 program size exceeds re2.max_program_size.error_level","+  envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_config_snapshot_result_InvalidRegex = 2,","+  // admin support is unavailable","+  envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_config_snapshot_result_Unavailable = 3,","+  // collection failed for any other reason, such as a provider that throws or returns no message","+  envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_config_snapshot_result_CollectionFailed = 4,","+} envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_config_snapshot_result;","+"," /**","  * The callback type invoked once per active resource name during enumeration.","  *","@@ -10568,6 +10604,63 @@ bool envoy_dynamic_module_callback_bootstrap_extension_remove_admin_handler(","     envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_extension_config_envoy_ptr extension_config_envoy_ptr,","     envoy_dynamic_module_type_module_buffer path_prefix);"," ","+// -------------------- Bootstrap Extension Callbacks - Configuration Snapshots --------------------","+","+/**","+ * Collects and redacts selected providers synchronously on the main thread. Missing providers are","+ * omitted, duplicates are collected once, and results are sorted by provider key. An empty","+ * selection collects nothing. Endpoint dumps are not included. Cost grows with the selected","+ * resources, so combine frequent notifications into one collection.","+ *","+ * Collection is refused in cluster or listener lifecycle hooks, whatever triggered them, and in","+ * other bootstrap hooks Envoy runs inside an xDS update or a resource's destruction. Providers can","+ * contain partial changes under the previous version. Defer collection with the bootstrap config","+ * scheduler. Callout failures during cluster removal are already reported from a posted callback.","+ *","+ * Only protobuf fields annotated as sensitive are redacted. Metadata, opaque strings and module","+ * configuration may retain sensitive data. No admin listener is needed, and admin allow_paths does","+ * not restrict access.","+ *","+ * @param config_envoy_ptr is the non-null pointer to the bootstrap extension configuration.","+ * @param providers is an array of provider keys, borrowed for this call. May be null only when","+ * providers_count is zero. Each key's pointer must be non-null when its length is nonzero.","+ * @param providers_count is the number of entries in providers.","+ * @param name_regex is a full-match RE2 resource name filter, ignored by providers without name","+ * filtering. A null pointer or zero length disables filtering. The buffer is borrowed for this","+ * call.","+ * @param snapshot_out is a non-null output pointer. Receives the module-owned snapshot on success,","+ * or null on failure. Release it with the snapshot delete callback before its config is destroyed.","+ * @return the collection result. A call off the main thread also reports an Envoy bug.","+ */","+envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_config_snapshot_result","+envoy_dynamic_module_callback_bootstrap_extension_config_snapshot_new(","+    envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_extension_config_envoy_ptr config_envoy_ptr,","+    const envoy_dynamic_module_type_module_buffer* providers, size_t providers_count,","+    envoy_dynamic_module_type_module_buffer name_regex,","+    envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_extension_config_snapshot_module_ptr* snapshot_out);","+","+/**","+ * Encodes the snapshot as envoy.admin.v3.ConfigDump JSON on any thread without consuming it.","+ * Encoding can be expensive; use a module-owned thread to avoid blocking Envoy's main thread or","+ * workers.","+ *","+ * @param snapshot is a non-null snapshot handle. Must not be used concurrently.","+ * @param json_fn is a non-null callback invoked synchronously once on success, and not on failure.","+ * @param user_data is an opaque pointer passed to json_fn and may be null.","+ * @return true on success, false if encoding fails, including for unknown or unlinked Any types.","+ */","+bool envoy_dynamic_module_callback_bootstrap_extension_config_snapshot_serialize(","+    envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_extension_config_snapshot_module_ptr snapshot,","+    envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_extension_config_snapshot_json_fn json_fn, void* user_data);","+","+/**","+ * Deletes a snapshot on any thread.","+ *","+ * @param snapshot is the snapshot to release, or null. Must not be in use by another call.","+ */","+void envoy_dynamic_module_callback_bootstrap_extension_config_snapshot_delete(","+    envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_extension_config_snapshot_module_ptr snapshot);","+"," // -------------------- Bootstrap Extension Callbacks - Cluster Lifecycle --------------------"," "," /**"],"additions":93,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"source/extensions/dynamic_modules/abi_impl.cc","lines":["@@ -522,6 +522,21 @@ WEAK_STUB(bool, envoy_dynamic_module_callback_bootstrap_extension_file_watcher_a"," WEAK_S